      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Two 19th‑century railroads crossed Hamlet; by the 1980s only the Pennsylvania mainline remained, now operated by the Chicago, Fort Wayne and Eastern Railroad for grain freight.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
