      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamlet%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hamlet’s public library, a branch of the Starke County Public Library System, reflects the town’s early commitment to education.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
